6. scripts/gameplay/fuel_system.gd:
- setup(config, vehicle_spec, plan, start_fuel_l := -1.0), where carried fuel takes priority over plan.start_fuel_fraction and the config;
- litres_for(km, v);
- static start_check(cfg, spec, plan, litres) → {first_km, lane_km (lane start + taper), need_l at lane_trigger_speed_kmh, max_kmh, state ok|tight|tow};
- a one-time start announcement in _announce_stations, only at pos_km < announce_window_km and only when no threshold fires; keep the rounding the same as the countdown text.

9. scripts/race/race_session.gd _build():
- pass the start fuel to fuel.setup and keep start_fuel_l;
- if start_check is 'tow': penalty_time += fuel.tow_penalty_s, refill to max(current, tow_refill_fraction), stats.tows += 1, start_towed = true;
- countdown message in race mode (tank and verdict); suppress the duplicate start announcement and Reserve message;
- for the last station of a race stage: message 'Letzte Tankstelle vor dem Ziel – der Tank geht in die nächste Etappe mit';
- _finish() stores _final_fuel_l;
- build_result adds fuel_start_l, fuel_end_l, tank_l, start_towed;
- autopilot.carry_km = first_station_max_km in race mode.

11. UI:
- scripts/ui/screens/stage_screen.gd: fuel strip under the map in both modes (pump icon, gauge, 'Tank voll' / '35 %' / 'Tank 23 / 60 L · erste Tankstelle nach 12 km' plus verdict from FuelSystem.start_check with the race vehicle's spec: green 'reicht auch mit Vollgas', yellow 'bis zur Tankstelle höchstens X km/h', red 'reicht nicht – Abschleppdienst vor dem Start +1:30, halber Tank');
- result_screen.gd: 'Tank im Ziel' line in races;
- UiFormat helpers;
- TutorialCoach: 'fuel_low' urgent, with the distance in the text;
- optional: track.gd puts a fuel sign with the real distance at km 0.3 when the first station lies before its first announcement threshold.

13. Tests:
- unit StagePlan: dir entries, mirroring, reverse drop does not hit dir-specific stations, unknown dir warning;
- test_network_data: first 5–20 km in both directions (prototype), end gap ≤ 90, range-vs-110-km config test;
- test_routing: counts Ost 8→9, West 11→14, legs_summary Ost 9→10; synthetic network with fwd/rev start stations;
- test_fuel_system: start announcement (12 km → announced(12) at km 0; 15 km → the 15-km threshold; start at 44 km → nothing), start_check ok/tight/tow and max_kmh;
- test_race_state / test_save_game: fuel_l roundtrip, ferry keeps it, old dict → -1;
- autopilot unit tests: carry_km and eco;
- check_session: new scenarios carry_tow (GT 1.9 L → towed before the start, +90 s, 30 L) and carry_eco (GT 3 L → ≤ 85 km/h, refuels, no tow); move refuel_chase off kiel_hamburg km 20 (no station ahead any more), e.g. to dev_testetappe (radar 12–17, station 20);
- tests/race/run_race.gd: carry-over check per leg plus fuel columns (prototype);
- attract: check rushhour, which now starts 0.3 km after a station.

